      "code": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save notes</button>\n<div class=\"alert alert-success\" role=\"status\">Your notes are saved.</div>",
      "explanation": "Bootstrap 5.3 button and success feedback. Load Bootstrap CSS; the application supplies save behavior.",
