      "title": "Tailwind utilities",
      "code": "<section class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\">\n  <article class=\"rounded-lg p-4 shadow\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Planting plan</h2>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2 text-white focus-visible:outline-2\">Save</button>\n  </article>\n</section>",
      "explanation": "Tailwind 4 responsive cards and a focus-visible action. Compile the classes to CSS before opening the page.",
